ooltip.custom{max-width:80vw}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip{display:block;position:absolute}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.above{bottom:100%;top:auto;margin-bottom:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.middle{bottom:auto;top:50%;margin-top:-1em}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.below{bottom:auto;top:100%;margin-top:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.left{left:0px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center{left:50%;margin-left:-125px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.narrow{margin-left:-50px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.fill{left:-262px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;right:-262px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.wide{margin-left:-225px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.right{left:auto;right:0px}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Cloth\" title=\"Cloth\">Cloth</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Cloth\" title=\"Cloth\">Cloth</a>:</b> <b>Cloth</b> is a very common material used in <a href=\"/page/Handwraps\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Handwraps\">handwraps</a>, <a href=\"/page/Category:Cloth_armor\" title=\"Category:Cloth armor\">robes, outfits</a>. and other <a href=\"/page/Accessories\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Accessories\">accessories</a>.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">22\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0008005500</span>8,005<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;5<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">gp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Gold Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><b><a href=\"/page/Eveningstar\" title=\"Eveningstar\">Eveningstar</a></b>, Turn in 10&#32;<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Item:Commendation:_Villagers_of_Eveningstar\" title=\"Item:Commendation: Villagers of Eveningstar\">Commendations: Villagers of Eveningstar</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Item:Commendation:_Villagers_of_Eveningstar\" title=\"Item:Commendation: Villagers of Eveningstar\">Commendation: Villagers of Eveningstar</a>:</b> This is a valuable item that can be exchanged for goods if brought to a Challenge Trader. This is a token of favor earned by helping the Villagers of Eveningstar. You can exchange it in <a href=\"/page/Eveningstar\" title=\"Eveningstar\">Eveningstar</a> for powerful equipment.</span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Armor_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Armor Bonus\">Armor Bonus +9</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Armor_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Armor Bonus\">Armor Bonus +9</a>:</b> This item surrounds the wearer with an invisible but tangible field of force, granting +9 armor bonus to AC, just as though he were wearing armor.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Resistance_(enchantment)\" title=\"Resistance (enchantment)\"> Resistance +6</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Resistance_(enchantment)\" title=\"Resistance (enchantment)\"> Resistance +6</a>:</b> Passive: +6 <a href=\"/page/Resistance_bonus\" title=\"Resistance bonus\">Resistance bonus</a> to Fortitude, Reflex, and Will Saving Throws.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enhanced_Ki\" title=\"Enhanced Ki\">Enhanced Ki +1</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhanced_Ki\" title=\"Enhanced Ki\">Enhanced Ki +1</a>:</b> Increases the rate at which the user gains ki with each successful attack.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Reinforced_Fists\" title=\"Reinforced Fists\">Reinforced Fists</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Reinforced_Fists\" title=\"Reinforced Fists\">Reinforced Fists</a>:</b> This item surrounds your fists with kinetic energy. Your unarmed damage is boosted by one half die.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Way_of_the_Sun_Soul\" title=\"Named item sets\">Way of the Sun Soul</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Way_of_the_Sun_Soul\" title=\"Named item sets\">Way of the Sun Soul</a>:</b> When all three item from the set are equipped and you are in a centered state, you will gain +2 <a href=\"/page/Artifact_bonus\" title=\"Artifact bonus\">artifact bonus</a> to To-Hit and Damage rolls. In addition, when you roll a natural 20 on an attack roll that is confirmed as a critical hit, you will gain temporary benefit based on the elemental stance you are in, if any.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD;\" rowspan=\"5\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Vestments_of_the_Sun_Soul.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Vestments_of_the_Sun_Soul.png/420px-Vestments_of_the_Sun_Soul.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"482\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Vestments_of_the_Sun_Soul.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><i>The Order of the Sun Soul is a monastic order dedicated to the welfare of the common fold of Faerun. This simple travelling garb is typical of the adventuring members of their order.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816173855\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.079 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.130 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4073/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 29856/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11086/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n127.06%  140.331     55 Template:IO\n100.00%  110.442      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  110.442      1 -total\n 94.90%  104.809      1 Template:Named_Armor\n 44.07%   48.668      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 43.15%   47.651      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 40.40%   44.622      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 39.24%   43.334      2 Template:InCategory\n 24.69%   27.273      9 Template:Popup\n 16.10%   17.782      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:24448-0!canonical and timestamp 20260816173855 and revision id 686655. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"
